# .gitignore - UTS AR Hardware Kelompok 3
# TARUH FILE INI DI FOLDER REPO PALING LUAR, sejajar README.md dan folder src/
# Jangan taruh di dalam folder project Unity.
#
# PENTING: folder build/ di repo paling luar SENGAJA TIDAK di-ignore,
# supaya APK hasil build bisa disimpan di repo.
# Yang di-ignore hanya folder Build/ DI DALAM project Unity (src/.../Build/).

# Folder hasil generate Unity - jangan di-commit
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]serSettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
src/ARHardwareKelompok3/[Bb]uild/
src/ARHardwareKelompok3/[Bb]uilds/

# File cache dan project Unity - jangan di-commit
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db

# File sistem - jangan di-commit
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
